# The line infantry of the period: close order, fire by volley on the word, stand under losses.
drill "Regulars"
about "Close order, volleys on the sergeant's word, stand under losses, go in with the bayonet after a good volley."
type Even
dials aggression 0.45 discipline 0.90 cohesion 0.85 cover 0.20 patience 0.60 nerve 0.65

sergeant:
  when enemy within 45 -> volley when 80% loaded

man:
  when volley called and loaded and enemy within 60 -> fire
  otherwise -> follow sergeant
